{"k":"cplx","t":"Complex Numbers","cls":"11","u":"Algebra","s":[["Basics",[{"q":"Powers of $i$","f":"i^{4k}=1,\\quad i^{4k+1}=i,\\quad i^{4k+2}=-1,\\quad i^{4k+3}=-i","n":"Sum of four consecutive powers of $i$ is $0$. Careful: $\\sqrt a\\sqrt b=\\sqrt{ab}$ fails when both $a,b<0$."},{"q":"Modulus and argument","f":"z=x+iy:\\quad |z|=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2},\\quad \\tan\\theta=\\frac yx","n":"Principal argument $\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]$; fix the quadrant from the signs of $x,y$."},{"q":"Polar and Euler form","f":"z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)=re^{i\\theta}"},{"q":"Conjugate properties","f":"z\\bar z=|z|^2,\\quad z+\\bar z=2\\operatorname{Re}z,\\quad z-\\bar z=2i\\operatorname{Im}z,\\quad \\overline{z_1z_2}=\\bar z_1\\bar z_2","n":"$z$ is purely real $\\iff z=\\bar z$; purely imaginary $\\iff z=-\\bar z$."},{"q":"Reciprocal of $z$","f":"\\frac1z=\\frac{\\bar z}{|z|^2}"},{"q":"Modulus rules","f":"|z_1z_2|=|z_1||z_2|,\\quad\\left|\\frac{z_1}{z_2}\\right|=\\frac{|z_1|}{|z_2|},\\quad |z^n|=|z|^n"},{"q":"Argument rules","f":"\\arg(z_1z_2)=\\arg z_1+\\arg z_2,\\quad \\arg\\frac{z_1}{z_2}=\\arg z_1-\\arg z_2\\quad(\\text{mod } 2\\pi)","n":"$\\arg\\bar z=-\\arg z$; $\\arg z^n=n\\arg z$ (mod $2\\pi$)."},{"q":"Triangle inequality","f":"\\big||z_1|-|z_2|\\big|\\le|z_1\\pm z_2|\\le|z_1|+|z_2|","n":"$|z_1+z_2|=|z_1|+|z_2|\\iff \\arg z_1=\\arg z_2$."},{"q":"Parallelogram law","f":"|z_1+z_2|^2+|z_1-z_2|^2=2\\left(|z_1|^2+|z_2|^2\\right)"},{"q":"Modulus of a sum squared","f":"|z_1+z_2|^2=|z_1|^2+|z_2|^2+2\\operatorname{Re}(z_1\\bar z_2)","n":"If $|z_1+z_2|=|z_1-z_2|$ then $\\arg\\frac{z_1}{z_2}=\\pm\\frac\\pi2$."},{"q":"Square root of $a+ib$","f":"\\sqrt{a+ib}=\\pm\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{|z|+a}{2}}+i\\,\\frac{b}{|b|}\\sqrt{\\frac{|z|-a}{2}}\\right)","n":"$|z|=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$, $b\\ne0$.","d":"Let $(x+iy)^2=a+ib$: $x^2-y^2=a$, $2xy=b$, and $x^2+y^2=|z|$. Solve."}]],["De Moivre and roots of unity",[{"q":"De Moivre's theorem","f":"(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta","n":"For integer $n$; for rational $n$ it gives one of the values."},{"q":"n-th roots of unity","f":"z^n=1\\Rightarrow z_k=e^{i2\\pi k/n},\\ k=0,1,\\dots,n-1","n":"Sum of all roots $=0$; product $=(-1)^{n-1}$; they form a regular $n$-gon on the unit circle."},{"q":"Sum of p-th powers of n-th roots of unity","f":"\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\omega_k^{\\,p}=\\begin{cases}n,& n\\mid p\\\\0,&\\text{otherwise}\\end{cases}"},{"q":"Cube roots of unity","f":"1,\\ \\omega=\\frac{-1+i\\sqrt3}{2},\\ \\omega^2=\\frac{-1-i\\sqrt3}{2};\\qquad 1+\\omega+\\omega^2=0,\\ \\omega^3=1","n":"$\\bar\\omega=\\omega^2$; $1+\\omega^n+\\omega^{2n}=3$ if $3\\mid n$, else $0$."},{"q":"Factorisations using $\\omega$","f":"a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca=(a+b\\omega+c\\omega^2)(a+b\\omega^2+c\\omega)","n":"$a^3+b^3=(a+b)(a+b\\omega)(a+b\\omega^2)$; $x^2+x+1=(x-\\omega)(x-\\omega^2)$."},{"q":"Product formula from n-th roots of unity","f":"x^{n}-1=\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}(x-\\omega_k)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}(1-\\omega_k)=n","d":"$\\frac{x^n-1}{x-1}=1+x+\\cdots+x^{n-1}=\\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}(x-\\omega_k)$; put $x=1$."},{"q":"Roots of $z^n=a$","f":"z_k=|a|^{1/n}e^{i(\\arg a+2k\\pi)/n},\\quad k=0,\\dots,n-1"}]],["Logarithm and powers",[{"q":"Logarithm of a complex number","f":"\\log z=\\ln|z|+i(\\arg z+2k\\pi)","n":"Principal value with $k=0$. $i^i=e^{-\\pi/2}$ (principal)."},{"q":"Euler forms of cos and sin","f":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{e^{i\\theta}+e^{-i\\theta}}{2},\\qquad \\sin\\theta=\\frac{e^{i\\theta}-e^{-i\\theta}}{2i}"}]],["Geometry with complex numbers",[{"q":"Distance between two points","f":"|z_1-z_2|"},{"q":"Section formula","f":"z=\\frac{mz_2+nz_1}{m+n}\\ (\\text{internal}),\\qquad z=\\frac{mz_2-nz_1}{m-n}\\ (\\text{external})"},{"q":"Centroid, incentre, circumcentre (equilateral)","f":"G=\\frac{z_1+z_2+z_3}{3},\\qquad I=\\frac{az_1+bz_2+cz_3}{a+b+c}"},{"q":"Rotation theorem","f":"\\frac{z_3-z_1}{z_2-z_1}=\\frac{|z_3-z_1|}{|z_2-z_1|}e^{i\\theta}","n":"$\\theta$ = angle from $\\overrightarrow{z_1z_2}$ to $\\overrightarrow{z_1z_3}$, anticlockwise."},{"q":"Collinearity of three points","f":"\\frac{z_3-z_1}{z_2-z_1}\\in\\mathbb R\\iff\\begin{vmatrix}z_1&\\bar z_1&1\\\\z_2&\\bar z_2&1\\\\z_3&\\bar z_3&1\\end{vmatrix}=0"},{"q":"Perpendicularity","f":"\\frac{z_3-z_1}{z_2-z_1}\\ \\text{purely imaginary}\\iff z_1z_3\\perp z_1z_2"},{"q":"Equilateral triangle condition","f":"z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2=z_1z_2+z_2z_3+z_3z_1","n":"Equivalent: $\\frac1{z_1-z_2}+\\frac1{z_2-z_3}+\\frac1{z_3-z_1}=0$. With centroid $z_0$: $z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2=3z_0^2$."},{"q":"Area of triangle","f":"\\Delta=\\frac{1}{4i}\\begin{vmatrix}z_1&\\bar z_1&1\\\\z_2&\\bar z_2&1\\\\z_3&\\bar z_3&1\\end{vmatrix}","n":"Take modulus for the magnitude."},{"q":"Equation of a line through $z_1,z_2$","f":"\\begin{vmatrix}z&\\bar z&1\\\\z_1&\\bar z_1&1\\\\z_2&\\bar z_2&1\\end{vmatrix}=0"},{"q":"General line","f":"\\bar a z+a\\bar z+b=0\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb R)","n":"Slope $=-\\frac{a+\\bar a}{i(a-\\bar a)}=-\\frac{\\operatorname{Re}a}{\\operatorname{Im}a}$; distance of $z_0$ from it $=\\frac{|\\bar az_0+a\\bar z_0+b|}{2|a|}$."},{"q":"Perpendicular bisector of $z_1z_2$","f":"|z-z_1|=|z-z_2|"},{"q":"Circle","f":"|z-z_0|=r\\iff z\\bar z-\\bar z_0z-z_0\\bar z+|z_0|^2-r^2=0","n":"General: $z\\bar z+\\bar az+a\\bar z+b=0$, centre $-a$, radius $\\sqrt{|a|^2-b}$."},{"q":"Circle on diameter $z_1z_2$","f":"(z-z_1)(\\bar z-\\bar z_2)+(z-z_2)(\\bar z-\\bar z_1)=0","n":"Equivalent: $\\arg\\frac{z-z_1}{z-z_2}=\\pm\\frac\\pi2$."},{"q":"Apollonius circle","f":"\\left|\\frac{z-z_1}{z-z_2}\\right|=k\\ (k\\ne1):\\ \\text{circle};\\quad k=1:\\ \\text{perpendicular bisector}"},{"q":"Arc locus","f":"\\arg\\frac{z-z_1}{z-z_2}=\\theta:\\ \\text{arc of a circle through } z_1,z_2","n":"$\\theta=0$ or $\\pi$: the line (outside / inside the segment)."},{"q":"Ellipse and hyperbola loci","f":"|z-z_1|+|z-z_2|=2a\\ (2a>|z_1-z_2|):\\ \\text{ellipse};\\qquad \\big||z-z_1|-|z-z_2|\\big|=2a\\ (2a<|z_1-z_2|):\\ \\text{hyperbola}"},{"q":"Concyclic points","f":"\\frac{(z_4-z_1)(z_2-z_3)}{(z_4-z_3)(z_2-z_1)}\\in\\mathbb R"},{"q":"Reflection of $z$ in the line $\\bar az+a\\bar z+b=0$","f":"\\bar a z'+a\\bar z+b=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ z'=-\\frac{a\\bar z+b}{\\bar a}"},{"q":"Range of $|z|$ given $|z-z_0|=r$","f":"\\big||z_0|-r\\big|\\le|z|\\le|z_0|+r"},{"q":"Maximum of $|z|$ when $\\left|z-\\frac{a}{z}\\right|=k$","f":"|z|_{\\max}=\\frac{k+\\sqrt{k^2+4|a|}}{2},\\qquad |z|_{\\min}=\\frac{-k+\\sqrt{k^2+4|a|}}{2}"}]]]}